{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05675","headline":"和左衞武仓曹衞中对雨创韵赠右衞李骑曹 · 孙逖","name":"和左衞武仓曹衞中对雨创韵赠右衞李骑曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林父同官意，宣尼久敬交。\n文场刊玉篆，武事掌金铙。\n道合宜连茹，时清岂系匏。\n克勤居簿领，多暇屏讙譊。\n美酒怀公讌，玄谈俟客嘲。\n薄云生北阙，飞雨自西郊。\n院暑便清旷，庭芜觉渐苞。\n高门关讵闭，逸韵柱难胶。\n枳棘鸾无叹，椅梧凤必巢。\n忽闻徵竝作，观海媿堂坳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}